Interesting but impossible according to my reading of the code. Gifts 
are handled by mk_artifact(), which in the case of gifts is called with 
the alignment of the altar you sacrifice on as a parameter (pray.c line 
1471). This will always be the same as your current alignment when a 
gift is generated. mk_artifact() will only create artifacts with the 
passed alignment, or artifacts with no alignment for gifts other than 
the first. Your "guaranteed first gift" will still have your starting 
alignment, and thus be unavailable for consideration.


